1. Quick comparison
Type	 Meaning	                                   Main purpose	                                                                Common tools
TDD	    Test-Driven Development	                    Write tests before implementation	                                            JUnit 5, Mockito
BDD	    Behavior-Driven Development	                Define expected behavior in business-readable scenarios	                        Cucumber, Gherkin
Unit testing	Test one small unit of code in isolation	Verify business logic	                                                JUnit, Mockito
Integration 	Test interactions between components	   Verify database, APIs, messaging, etc.	                                Spring Boot Test, Testcontainers
Functional 	    Test whether a feature meets its requirements	 Verify end-to-end functionality	                                REST Assured, Selenium, Postman